<title>FRANCE: Bollore H1 net attrib 62 mln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Bollore H1 net attrib 62 mln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable				62  vs		76</p>
<p>    Net after goodwill amortisation	  168  vs	     158</p>
<p>    Operating					423  vs	     481</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-exceptional		   337  vs	     323</p>
<p>    Turnover				    10,831  vs	  11,187</p>
<p>NOTE - Diversified group Bollore Technologies gave its results in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
